From 85de7dabaf89633df89957155145e3ad0e6166bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anshul Singhvi <anshulintheusa@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:52:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] js: text host jobs (wasm_host.text_start/text_finish): glyph
 coverage bitmaps and metrics from Canvas2D

A WasmHost text backend for programs compiled by WasmCodegen that cannot run FreeType.
Protocol 'wasm-text 1' (js/common/text.mjs): font, extent, glyph and measure jobs,
started without suspending and finished through a julia_io external handle (as http_start/http_finish).
Browser backend on Canvas2D (js/browser/text.mjs); a deterministic MOCK for Node (js/node/text_mock.mjs).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
